The '''Mykapo system''' was a [[star system]] in the [[Ash Worlds]] [[sector]] of the [[Outer Rim Territories]]<ref name="Appendix" /> that contained the [[planet]] [[Mykapo]] and its lone [[Star|sun]].<ref name="Iron Squadron" /> A [[Krawg pirates|group]] of [[Krawg]] [[pirate]]s operated in the Mykapo system.<ref name="Star Wars 34">[[Star Wars (2015) 34|''Star Wars'' (2015) 34]]</ref>

